{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49393","headline":"赞成功 · 毛文锡","name":"赞成功","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海棠未坼，万点深红，香包缄结一重重。\n似含羞态，邀勒春风，蜂来蝶去，任遶芳丛。\n昨夜微雨，飘洒庭中，忽闻声滴井边桐。\n美人惊起，坐听晨钟，快教折取，戴玉珑璁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}